    3. Alpha-Wave Sub-Basses: Psytrance squelches layered with ultra-low 432Hz sine drones meant to induce lucid dreaming during transit.
*   Dynamics: Tracks begin as hushed, meditative train-cabin ambiances before erupting without warning into dense, kaleidoscopic brass-acid peaks, maintaining a surreal balance between frantic dancefloor energy and deep physiological relaxation.

